VaultClaw

VaultClaw is a security-hardened distribution of OpenClaw
(https://openclaw.ai), which is licensed under the MIT License,
Copyright (c) 2025 Peter Steinberger.

The upstream project provides the gateway, agent runtime, channel
adapters, and the skill and extension system. VaultClaw's contribution is
the security hardening layer: container hardening, secrets handling,
gateway authentication, DM pairing, network defaults, and the deployment
topology documented in this repository.

